            8,
            32,
            12,
            32
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "lead",
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<p>On Sunday 2 November between 02:00 and 04:00 CET, Northwind moves to new data centres that run on renewable energy.</p>",
          "size": 17,
          "padding": [
            0,
            32,
            8,
            32
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cta",
          "type": "button",
          "label": "Read the details",
          "url": "https://example.com/announcement",
          "align": "left",
          "padding": [
            16,
            32,
            8,
            32
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "body",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<p>You do not need to do anything. Your data, links and settings stay exactly as they are. During the move the app may be slow for a few minutes; deliveries in progress are not affected.</p><p>Afterwards pages load about 30% faster, and every shipment you send is carried by servers powered by wind and sun.</p>",
      "padding": [
        24,
        32,
        8,
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sign",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<p>Thank you for trusting us with your deliveries,<br>The Northwind team</p>",
      "padding": [
        8,
        32,
        16,
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "footer",
      "type": "footer",
      "html": "<p>We send service announcements only when something affects your account.</p>",
      "padding": [
        16,
        32,
        8,
        32
      ]
    }
  ]
